@startuml
title Relational Access v1 - Connection Ownership / Release Lifecycle

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

state "REQUEST\nConnectionProvider.acquire" as REQUEST
state "DEFAULT_OWNED\nDefaultConnectionProvider\nDataSource.getConnection" as DEFAULT_OWNED
state "SPRING_OWNED\nSpring Provider\nno ambient transaction" as SPRING_OWNED
state "SPRING_BORROWED\nSpring Provider\ntransaction-bound connection" as SPRING_BORROWED
state "USING_CONNECTION" as USING
state "PHYSICAL_CLOSE_OR_POOL_RETURN" as PHYSICAL_RELEASE
state "LOGICAL_RELEASE_ONLY" as LOGICAL_RELEASE
state "OUTER_TRANSACTION_COMMIT_ROLLBACK" as OUTER_TX
state "OUTER_PHYSICAL_RELEASE" as OUTER_RELEASE

[*] --> REQUEST

REQUEST --> DEFAULT_OWNED : DefaultConnectionProvider
REQUEST --> SPRING_OWNED : SpringProvider\nno bound tx
REQUEST --> SPRING_BORROWED : SpringProvider\nDataSourceUtils.isConnectionTransactional=true

DEFAULT_OWNED --> USING
SPRING_OWNED --> USING
SPRING_BORROWED --> USING

USING --> PHYSICAL_RELEASE : handle.close()\nDEFAULT OWNED -> Connection.close
USING --> PHYSICAL_RELEASE : handle.close()\nSPRING OWNED -> DataSourceUtils.doReleaseConnection
USING --> LOGICAL_RELEASE : handle.close()\nSPRING BORROWED -> DataSourceUtils.doReleaseConnection

PHYSICAL_RELEASE --> [*]
LOGICAL_RELEASE --> OUTER_TX : physical connection remains bound
OUTER_TX --> OUTER_RELEASE : commit / rollback
OUTER_RELEASE --> [*]

note bottom of SPRING_BORROWED
BORROWED is the key to MyBatis + RelationalTemplate
sharing one physical local transaction.
end note

@enduml
